WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Honda uses the overhead as Ryu wakes up.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.650
Honda rises into heavy Sumo Smash while Ryu’s DP misses.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.900
Standing medium punch punishes Ryu’s recovery after Honda lands.

4
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.500
Sumo Lift launches Ryu during the punish.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.850
Heavy Sumo Smash completes the punish conversion.
